Third-party code
----------------
internal/vecext/sqlite-vec.c and sqlite-vec.h are vendored from
github.com/asg017/sqlite-vec-go-bindings v0.1.6 (sqlite-vec, by Alex Garcia).
The upstream repository's license terms apply to those two files; see
https://github.com/asg017/sqlite-vec.

internal/vecext/sqlite3.h is an unmodified copy of sqlite3-binding.h from
github.com/mattn/go-sqlite3 v1.14.52, renamed so an #include resolves. It
carries the SQLite public-domain dedication in its header.

Go module dependencies (github.com/mattn/go-sqlite3, the MCP Go SDK,
fsnotify, and others listed in go.mod) are used under their own licenses and
are not redistributed in this repository.
